# F11's table of folders full (OFX_TEST_FOLDERS_MEM: 8 KiB, run.sh): each cursor kept as a folder
# is left takes its name's bytes, and a write past half the room starts the strings afresh. Without
# it the room runs out after about 40 keeps of this 200-byte name, and the cursor is forgotten.
settle
expect sel=d
key enter
expect sel=a
key down
expect sel=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
key backspace
